  "evidence": "- TEXT_G: Pro-EU stance (stop Brexit, Remain on the ballot, revoke Article 50); liberal migration (Scottish Visa, end hostile environment, protect free movement, expand refugee resettlement, end indefinite detention); entrench human rights (defend ECHR/HRA, UNCRC); abolish House of Lords, votes at 16, extend franchise to EU citizens; scrap Trident; ambitious climate action and opposition to fracking.\n- TEXT_F: Liberal migration/humanitarian borders (end hostile environment and indefinite detention; safe routes for refugees); expand equality rights (women’s, BAME, disabled, LGBT+); democratic reforms (abolish House of Lords, votes at 16); pro-EU second referendum with Remain option; strong climate agenda; TAN-leaning elements: maintain NATO, renew Trident, and rebuild neighborhood policing.",
